### GlobalTrust Secure Bank — IntelliJ HTTP client walkthrough
# Run top to bottom. Auth is pre-encoded HTTP Basic; C1 captures the transfer id automatically.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### A1. Who am I? (alice / CUSTOMER)
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### A2. Customer cannot read the audit log -> 403
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### A3. Auditor can read the audit log -> 200
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Basic YXJpYTpwYXNzd29yZA==

### B. Clark-Wilson: small transfer auto-executes (<= 1000)
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6cGFzc3dvcmQ=
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccount": "ACC-1001", "toAccount": "ACC-1002", "amount": 500, "reason": "rent" }

### C1. Maker (victor) creates an above-threshold transfer -> PENDING_APPROVAL
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic dmljdG9yOnBhc3N3b3Jk
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccount": "ACC-9000", "toAccount": "ACC-1001", "amount": 2500, "reason": "ops top-up" }

> {% client.global.set("transferId", response.body.id); %}

### C2. Same person approves their own -> 403 Separation of Duty Violation
POST {{base}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/approve
Authorization: Basic dmljdG9yOnBhc3N3b3Jk

### C3. A different approver (wendy) approves -> EXECUTED
POST {{base}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/approve
Authorization: Basic d2VuZHk6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### D1. Chinese Wall: open Acme (TECH) -> granted, advisor now walled to Acme
GET {{base}}/api/advisory/companies/1
Authorization: Basic ZGlhbmE6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### D2. Open Globex (TECH competitor) -> 403 Chinese Wall Violation
GET {{base}}/api/advisory/companies/2
Authorization: Basic ZGlhbmE6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### D3. Open Initech (PHARMA, different class) -> granted
GET {{base}}/api/advisory/companies/3
Authorization: Basic ZGlhbmE6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### E1. Admin provisions a new user (admin power)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Basic YWRhbTpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "carol", "password": "password", "fullName": "Carol Customer", "role": "CUSTOMER", "department": "RETAIL" }

### E2. Admin tries to move money -> 403 (no business authority)
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic YWRhbTpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccount": "ACC-9000", "toAccount": "ACC-1001", "amount": 100, "reason": "should fail" }

### F. Full audit trail (newest first)
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Basic YXJpYTpwYXNzd29yZA==
